          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">What do I wear?</div><p class="know-a">Turf shoes or flat-soled trainers and shinguards. No metal studs.</p></div>
          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">How big is a 6v6 squad?</div><p class="know-a">Six on the field; rosters usually carry 9–10 so you can rotate. Register solo and we'll place you.</p></div>
          {/* Parking + roster guidance need an owner confirm — flagged in the PR body. */}
          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">Is there parking?</div><p class="know-a">Free lot right at the building on Starr Ave.</p></div>
          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">Can people watch?</div><p class="know-a">Yes — spectator seating and standing room along the field.</p></div>
          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">Is it hard to find?</div><p class="know-a">It's tucked in a quiet pocket — look for the long white building between Gray St and Loew St, entrance on the Starr Ave side. Full directions below.</p></div>
          <div class="know-item"><div class="know-q">How late are you open?</div><p class="know-a">4pm to midnight, every day.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         FINDING STARR AVE — wayfinding-forward directional map
    ============================================================ -->
    <section class="sec directions" aria-label="Finding Starr Ave">
      <div class="sec-inner">
        <div class="kicker-bar"></div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Finding Starr Ave</h2>
        <p class="sec-desc">We're tucked in Milo-Grogan — two minutes off the highway, but trust the turns, not your instincts.</p>
        <div class="dir-grid">
